+Five endpoints carry it:
+\begin{itemize}
+\item \verb|congrOrbit_upper_of_birkhoff| --- Birkhoff at $DMD$ reduces to
+  Birkhoff at $M$. This is Lemma~\ref{lem:deltainv} doing its work: the
