+294A / MARGINAL INDISTINGUISHABILITY AND SLOW TRANSFER SPECTRA
+13 November2026. Cross-paper synthesis candidate; separate audit required.
+Preregistration c0091b78d9bc9a746ac03dd8e31ff9ef3879fdb6.
